<p>Using a combination of&nbsp;Hypertext Markup Language (HTML), Cascading Style Sheets (CSS), and JavaScript (JS), students can create interactive and responsive websites for projects and for whatever they choose to do. In the rapidly growing internet, it is easy to create projects to learn&nbsp;about how these sites are made and how they work.&nbsp;</p><br />
